        "source_doc_path": "SPEC.md",
        "text": "**Mode 1, relay/active (Intercept)**: the console is connected. The ESP32 takes the knob and the console's motor drive in as signals, emulates the encoder toward the console and drives the motor through an H-bridge (\"console as signal source\", `docs/mitm-encoder-design-notes.md` §11). The Echelon app runs unchanged."
      }
    },
